---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /careers.html
title: Careers
seoTitle: "Careers at Nevark Technologies | Open Roles"
description: Careers at Nevark Technologies, Hosur. Build AI, software and industrial systems that run on real factory floors, fleets and homes. See open roles.
heroEyebrow: Careers
heroTitle: Build What Runs the Real World
heroLead: We hire smart people so they can tell us what to do. Join a focused team engineering AI, software and hardware that ships to production.
scripts: ["/js/forms.js"]
breadcrumbs: [{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Careers", url: "/careers" }]
---
{%- set perks = [
  { icon: "rocket", title: "Real-World Impact", text: "Your work runs on production lines and in the field, not in a slide deck." },
  { icon: "brain-circuit", title: "Learn Continuously", text: "AI, embedded, full stack and hardware under one roof, with room to go deep." },
  { icon: "users", title: "Ownership", text: "Small teams, direct access to leadership and decisions made by the people closest to the problem." },
  { icon: "sparkles", title: "Startup India Recognised", text: "Join a DPIIT-recognised company early and help shape how it grows." }
] -%}
{%- set steps = ["Apply with your profile or CV link", "Intro call with our team (30 min)", "Technical conversation or practical task", "Meet the founders and receive an offer"] -%}

<section class="px-6 pb-16" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 id="why-title" class="sr-only">Why Nevark</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {%- for p in perks %}
      <div class="card p-6 reveal">
        <span class="w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/10 text-indigo-300">{% icon p.icon, "w-5 h-5" %}</span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">{{ p.title }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">{{ p.text }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="open-roles" class="px-6 py-16 border-t border-white/10" aria-labelledby="roles-title">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 id="roles-title" class="section-title">Open Roles</h2>
    {%- if collections.jobs.length %}
    <ul class="mt-8 divide-y divide-white/10 card">
      {%- for job in collections.jobs %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ job.url }}" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-6 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
          <span class="flex-1"><span class="block text-lg font-semibold text-white">{{ job.data.title }}</span><span class="block text-sm text-gray-400">{{ job.data.department }}</span></span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">{{ job.data.location }}</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">{{ job.data.type }}</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-400">View role {% icon "arrow-right", "w-4 h-4" %}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="mt-8 card p-8 text-gray-300">
      <p class="text-lg text-white font-medium">No open positions right now.</p>
      <p class="mt-2">We're always happy to hear from exceptional engineers, designers and problem-solvers. Send a general application below and we'll reach out when there's a fit.</p>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-6 py-16 border-t border-white/10" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 id="process-title" class="section-title">How We Hire</h2>
    <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {%- for s in steps %}
      <li class="card p-6 reveal"><span class="text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-400">0{{ loop.index }}</span><p class="mt-3 text-gray-200">{{ s }}</p></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="apply" class="px-6 py-16 border-t border-white/10" aria-labelledby="apply-title">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto card p-6 md:p-10">
    <h2 id="apply-title" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold">{{ "Apply" if collections.jobs.length else "General Application" }}</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-300">Share a link to your CV (Google Drive, Dropbox or similar) or your LinkedIn profile.</p>
    {% set roleOptions = collections.jobs %}{% include "partials/apply-form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
